{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15075","headline":"投珠於泉 · 独孤绶","name":"投珠於泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至道归淳朴，明珠被弃捐。\n天真来照乘，成性却沈泉。\n不是灵蛇吐，非缘合浦还。\n岸傍随月落，波底共星悬。\n致远终无胫，怀贪遂息肩。\n欲知恭俭德，所宝在惟贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤绶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}